5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"We must judge by the last decade’s failures, not just pretty drawings.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,Agreed. I need to know if the ground will hold the new structures.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mio,,I’m worried about the bills after the ribbon is cut. Who pays for the upkeep?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,The city’s maintenance rota is shrinking. I need to know who actually works here.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,Paper plans ignore the rain. I need to see how the water actually moves.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mio, exactly. If the concrete cracks in year two, the budget vanishes.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Benjamin, true. But if the soil shifts, the concrete never even gets poured.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mio,,"I’ll check the fund terms. If it’s a one-off grant, we’re doomed.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"I’ll look at the groundskeeping roll. If the staff is gone, the park is dead.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I’ll check the drainage callouts. If the ground stays wet, nothing grows.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll review the condition of works from the earlier programme.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I’ll check the regional firms tendering for earth-moving.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Mio,,I’ll also look at the upkeep ledger spend per hectare.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I’ll also check the volunteer groups working with the division.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,I’ll also check the timed counts of weekday crossings.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Let’s see what the data says before we pick a winner.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I want to know if the contractors can actually finish on time.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Mio,,I want to know if the city can afford to keep the lights on.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I want to know if there are enough hands to sweep the leaves.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minako,,I want to know if the paths stay dry when the August heat hits.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
