60,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,Option A is the only one that matches the durability of the overflow basin. The others are just expensive art.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Benjamin, Option A is the only one the firms can build without hitting the clay. The others require deep work.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, Option A is the only one that fits the fund terms. The others require money we do not have.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, Option A is the only one the volunteers can manage. The others require staff we do not have.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, Option A is the only one that matches the foot traffic. The others are just mud.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,I am voting for A. It is the only plan that will still look good in ten years.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Misaki,,I am voting for A. It is the only plan that can be built on this ground.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Mio,,I am voting for A. It is the only plan that will not bankrupt the city in three years.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Asuka,,I am voting for A. It is the only plan that the existing staff and volunteers can actually run.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Minako,,I am voting for A. It is the only plan that respects the way people actually use the park.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,The data is unanimous. We have no choice but to pick the pragmatic option.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Misaki,,The construction constraints are absolute. We cannot ignore the soil.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Mio,,The financial constraints are absolute. We cannot ignore the ledger.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Asuka,,The staffing constraints are absolute. We cannot ignore the roll.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Minako,,The environmental constraints are absolute. We cannot ignore the drainage.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Let us record the vote. The decision is made by the evidence, not by sentiment.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Misaki,,I am ready to vote. The risk is too high for anything else.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
